WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:05.500
*fun Indian beat*

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:08.000
What the heck?... It's silver.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.500
Is this supposed to have foil on it?

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:11.750
Seriously. Am I supposed to eat that?

00:00:11.750 --> 00:00:13.500
You have to tell me if I can't eat it.

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:17.750
It's almost like the inside of a nutter butter but better than a nutter butter. 

00:00:17.750 --> 00:00:18.750
So nutty.

00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:20.000
It tastes like it needs to be cooked.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:21.250
It tastes like raw cookie dough.

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:22.500
This is fancy.

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:27.500
Like something you'd see at a really fancy tea party at the turn of the last century.

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:30.000
I wish more American desserts were sparkly.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.500
I would like to make jewelry out it though.

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:35.000
India, I'm into your desserts.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:36.750
*fun Indian beat*

00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:38.250
It's kulfi time!

00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:40.000
Do not want you getting into these.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:41.250
*ripping plastic*

00:00:41.250 --> 00:00:42.750
Is this a banana?

00:00:42.750 --> 00:00:43.750
*chuckles*

00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:46.000
Why is it so wiggly? 

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:47.750
The size is a little intimidating.

00:00:47.750 --> 00:00:49.000
Oh! That's really good.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:50.250
I would totally eat this.

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:52.000
It tastes like a gourmet cupcake.

00:00:53.250 --> 00:00:56.750
This is so good... Wow, where have we been?

00:00:56.750 --> 00:00:57.750
I like this a lot.

00:00:57.750 --> 00:00:58.750
Should I not eat the whole thing?

00:00:58.750 --> 00:01:00.000
No, it's yours.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:04.250
Oh good 'cause this is the f*cking bomb. Jesus.

00:01:04.250 --> 00:01:05.250
*biting sound*

00:01:05.250 --> 00:01:06.750
*fun Indian beat*

00:01:06.750 --> 00:01:08.250
Hmmm.

00:01:08.250 --> 00:01:09.250
Just touch it?

00:01:09.250 --> 00:01:11.250
Cold. Colder than I thought.

00:01:11.250 --> 00:01:13.250
This is very confusing.

00:01:13.250 --> 00:01:14.500
It's so cute and squishy!

00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:15.750
It smells good.

00:01:15.750 --> 00:01:17.250
What secrets do you hold?

00:01:17.250 --> 00:01:19.250
Oh my God!

00:01:19.250 --> 00:01:20.750
*squealing noise*

00:01:20.750 --> 00:01:22.000
Why is it so wet?

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:23.000
*straining noise*

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:24.500
You can literally wring this out.

00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:26.000
*light chuckle*

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:27.250
That's like a magic trick.

00:01:27.250 --> 00:01:28.500
It's good. I like.

00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:30.000
*fun Indian beat*

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:32.000
It looks like a golden potato.

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:33.500
It's almost overwhelming.

00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:35.500
It's like a saturated syrup sack.

00:01:35.500 --> 00:01:36.750
Good amount of grease.

00:01:36.750 --> 00:01:38.750
It seems like the majority of Indian desserts are balls.

00:01:38.750 --> 00:01:42.500
But it tastes like a really, really good donut.

00:01:42.500 --> 00:01:43.000
It tastes almost too good.

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:45.000
But like your hands get so messy.

00:01:46.250 --> 00:01:48.750
This one makes me feel a little guilty and I don't know why.

00:01:48.750 --> 00:01:50.000
*fun Indian beat*

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:53.250
Oh my gosh! It's beautiful!

00:01:53.250 --> 00:01:55.000
Oh f*ck!

00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:57.250
Whoa! So sticky.

00:01:57.250 --> 00:01:58.000
Woo!

00:01:58.000 --> 00:01:59.000
Sh*t just got real.

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:02.750
This is something like Americans would get at a carnival.

00:02:02.750 --> 00:02:04.500
I would eat this at a fair.

00:02:04.500 --> 00:02:07.750
And then you would immediately throw up on the first ride that you went on.

00:02:07.750 --> 00:02:09.000
This is a lot to handle.

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:09.750
Yeah!

00:02:09.750 --> 00:02:10.500
Ooo!

00:02:10.500 --> 00:02:11.500
Goopidy goop!

00:02:11.500 --> 00:02:12.500
This is a delight.

00:02:12.500 --> 00:02:14.750
God bless whoever made this. Oh my gosh.

00:02:14.750 --> 00:02:16.250
How does this exist?

00:02:16.250 --> 00:02:29.250
*fun Indian beat*

